{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hermes is \u201cbusy\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on those shoes and get running, kid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parkour in a reimagined 2000s Greek city while you deface billboards and deliver messages for the disgruntled God Hermes. Enjoy expressing yourself in this punk modern take on Greek mythology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed-based movement system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Witty voice acting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 deliveries to colorful characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spray painting, sticker tagging, paint bombs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hermes' Runner is produced by Hermes Devs LLC, a member owned indie studio brought to you by senior students at Utah Games. We hope you enjoy early access, and we hope you keep up with our upcoming final touches!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536730?t=1741030850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3536730?t=1741030850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/c4382c3ea4cca1e782523cca3a9d906e0d293bdb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741030850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536730/c4382c3ea4cca1e782523cca3a9d906e0d293bdb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741030850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hermes is \u201cbusy\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put on those shoes and get running, kid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parkour in a reimagined 2000s Gree